# mcp__baton_get_project_context — baton/get_project_context

Load the project's summary, latest checkpoint (current goal, progress, failed attempts, next steps), unfinished work on other branches, active decisions and recent notes. Call this before resuming work.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** Project id: the git remote URL of origin (any form; normalized server-side, e.g. git@github.com:org/repo.git -> github.com/org/repo), or the content of .agent/project-id. */
  slug: string;
  /** Current git branch, if any. */
  branch?: string;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://mcp__baton_get_project_context.

